	<Folder>
		<name>深圳欢乐谷</name>
		<description>深圳欢乐谷

制作人：William Long
地址：http://www.williamlong.info/google</description>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷入口（检票口）</name>
			<description><![CDATA[欢乐谷的入口处
<img src="http://static.flickr.com/80/282189493_92bc570c32_o.jpg" border="0" alt="">]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.9744205505786</longitude>
				<latitude>22.54137293185981</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>252.0803495976816</range>
				<tilt>0</tilt>
				<heading>-0.04194881279478394</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9740229234915,22.5414120715351,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷过山车（雪山飞龙）</name>
			<description><![CDATA[香格里拉森林重点项目雪山飞龙是中国第一座悬挂式过山车。
<img src="http://static.flickr.com/122/282190227_d88953b8b6_o.jpg" border="0" alt="">
]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.9770416659951</longitude>
				<latitude>22.54753655649702</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>199.5383065049989</range>
				<tilt>0</tilt>
				<heading>-0.04094407056447962</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.976840876217,22.54749724014289,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷自由落体（太空梭）</name>
			<description><![CDATA[1.8秒瞬间高速弹射到60米高空，再自由落体直线下坠，瞬间失重的太空体验冒险刺激。
<img src="http://static.flickr.com/94/282189656_180b92e4fe_o.jpg" border="0" alt="">
]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.977018710633</longitude>
				<latitude>22.54247063455367</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>225.2390182587296</range>
				<tilt>0</tilt>
				<heading>-0.04095324114009231</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9771110909623,22.54244128138504,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷UFO</name>
			<description><![CDATA[一个巨大的转盘，好象外星人的坐驾，它沿着U型的星际轨道缓缓滑向地面，转盘按顺时针和逆时针交替着快速旋转，20多个身着盔甲的古欧洲骑士环坐在中心转盘的外围，在呼啸的风中滑翔。
<a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/williamlong/282189749/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/110/282189749_5e894ce99d_o.jpg" width="800" height="600" alt="UFO" /></a>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.9748530601742</longitude>
				<latitude>22.54290640733956</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>126.1393932712598</range>
				<tilt>0</tilt>
				<heading>-0.04178352030787244</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9745829737481,22.54310468480242,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷发现者</name>
			<description><![CDATA[乘上这个钢铁转盘旋转，乘客可以充分享受到在大型秋千上遨游的乐趣。
<a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/williamlong/282190556/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/107/282190556_19c1eab8df_o.jpg" width="800" height="600" alt="faxianzhe" /></a>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.974763099362</longitude>
				<latitude>22.54303416067942</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>117.2485530555398</range>
				<tilt>0</tilt>
				<heading>-0.04181819394801085</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9748866500828,22.54287095885102,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷龙卷风</name>
			<description><![CDATA[一个庞大的铁爪将乘客抓离地面，一股不可欲知的神秘力量迅速开始聚集，载着大家在半空中翻滚、起落，就似挣扎于风暴眼。随着能量的爆发，顺时针旋转与逆时针旋转相互交替，形成了一股强大的能量风暴。
<a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/williamlong/282189835/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/100/282189835_0b59f8a414_o.jpg" width="800" height="600" alt="longjuanfeng" /></a>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.974851944354</longitude>
				<latitude>22.5427684955221</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>126.864555583289</range>
				<tilt>9.374017161427621e-011</tilt>
				<heading>-0.04178415785403516</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9745675454874,22.54280986030329,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷寻梦河</name>
			<description><![CDATA[小舟装载着我们随着奔涌的岩浆肆意漂荡，寒冷的熔岩山洞，两面不时坠落的山体流水。
<a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/williamlong/282189939/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/99/282189939_0c583e9789_o.jpg" width="800" height="600" alt="xunmenghe" /></a>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.9748875852844</longitude>
				<latitude>22.54264820719592</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>77.13602524084263</range>
				<tilt>0</tilt>
				<heading>-0.04177049718795785</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9750355716901,22.54270818517605,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷影视拍摄场（地雷战）</name>
			<description><![CDATA[这里上演的《地道战》再现了当年抗日战争波澜壮阔的历史画卷，将人们带到烽烟滚滚的烽火岁月。您可穿上演出服，参与到《地道战》的现场拍摄中，与演员一同表演。
<a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/williamlong/282190671/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/113/282190671_dc91425024_o.jpg" width="800" height="600" alt="dileizhan" /></a>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.9750092335984</longitude>
				<latitude>22.5434818077046</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>155.7535819457936</range>
				<tilt>2.900866527542606e-011</tilt>
				<heading>-0.04172383070852941</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9749385835932,22.54347156362339,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷漂流河</name>
			<description><![CDATA[金矿漂流全长350米，游客坐在漂流筏里，经过犬牙交错的溶洞、激荡回旋的旋涡、累累欲坠的危石、高压水枪的偷袭，最后湿痕累累的回到岸上，开心大笑之后再用水枪偷袭别人。
<a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/williamlong/282189559/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/83/282189559_2f2b0d51aa_o.jpg" width="800" height="600" alt="piaoliuhe" /></a>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.9765719436833</longitude>
				<latitude>22.54411943529293</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>151.2762690960745</range>
				<tilt>7.27501390067787e-011</tilt>
				<heading>-0.04112468758385592</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9764523782303,22.54435190850228,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷矿山车过山车</name>
			<description><![CDATA[这是国内第一座巷道式矿山车。游客将重温1919年山洪爆发时矿工乘坐矿山车狼狈逃生的惊心动魄的场面，体验矿井逃生历险的刺激。
<a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/williamlong/282190047/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/103/282190047_a9e939a4d9_o.jpg" width="800" height="600" alt="kuangshanche" /></a>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.9767582262398</longitude>
				<latitude>22.54530760702511</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>285.2346879319492</range>
				<tilt>8.261203596932964e-011</tilt>
				<heading>-0.04105327083758512</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9771064234376,22.54554354172063,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷欢乐水世界</name>
			<description><![CDATA[《欢乐水世界》将在2万平方米的水面上重现远古土著生活、激烈的海战、凶狠的海盗、浪漫的双人绸吊特技，再现神话中的水晶宫殿、美丽的公主、神秘的水幕电影、气势惊人的火幕等。
<a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/williamlong/282190812/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/87/282190812_f7e7812166_o.jpg" width="640" height="480" alt="shuishijie" /></a>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.9761990174777</longitude>
				<latitude>22.5462738335566</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>292.0248150189022</range>
				<tilt>2.157815852283954e-010</tilt>
				<heading>-0.04126767565054038</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9757444283319,22.5467276860178,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷激流勇进</name>
			<description><![CDATA[这世界上落差最高的"激流勇进"。游客乘坐老渔翁LOUIS的旅游船，去寻找沉睡海底的宝藏，小船被卷入海湾的风暴漩涡中，途中经历种种奇遇，最终体验从26米高处飞驰而下的刺激！
<a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/williamlong/282190462/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/112/282190462_a41b8658d5_o.jpg" width="800" height="600" alt="jiliuyongjin" /></a>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.9749854997103</longitude>
				<latitude>22.54607819907498</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>215.4307492435981</range>
				<tilt>9.268651750148063e-011</tilt>
				<heading>-0.0417329717718249</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9746245162839,22.54599949660585,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷完美风暴</name>
			<description><![CDATA[这本是一个渔民的织网机，却被老渔翁改造成了独一无二的娱乐项目。玩了之后您才知道什么是神魂颠倒，什么是天旋地转！
<a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/williamlong/282190342/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/91/282190342_4dc8fdaaa0_o.jpg" width="800" height="600" alt="wanmeifengbao" /></a>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.975067430136</longitude>
				<latitude>22.54627480353796</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>215.7888121555262</range>
				<tilt>9.268652459844653e-011</tilt>
				<heading>-0.0417015560679392</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9747567929374,22.54666236429874,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷香格里拉森林</name>
			<description><![CDATA[这是通往藏北雪域香格里拉森林的大门，大山、溶洞、峡谷、雄鹰、森林、黑熊、瀑布、猴子……营造了一个悠远、知足、和谐的天地，在宁静的夜晚，仿佛来到了一个有"蓝月亮"的山谷。
<a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/williamlong/282190137/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/87/282190137_1eccf4491a_o.jpg" width="800" height="600" alt="xianggelila" /></a>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.9776192851619</longitude>
				<latitude>22.54648884016061</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>316.105741397156</range>
				<tilt>5.280040227698383e-011</tilt>
				<heading>-0.0407231996048725</heading>
			</LookAt>
			<styleUrl>#default0_copy0</styleUrl>
			<Point>
				<coordinates>113.9769697410927,22.54627172628146,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>欢乐谷玛雅水公园</name>
			<description><![CDATA[玛雅水公园.
<a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/williamlong/282189257/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/95/282189257_c1457afe35_o.jpg" width="450" height="300" alt="mayagongyuan" /></a>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
				<longitude>113.9760399939429</longitude>
				<latitude>22.54403712468632</latitude>
				<altitude>0</altitude>
				<range>306.1973066561587</range>
